  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-brick-building-day-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b549b0cff4bfcdadc77a61e91058cbff9df8e2751d6974282fa64805b32a258c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a5d7d3e128da4ae7bbf9653cc0e3bec64af73b6743774b8e298734abc885f76",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nBrick-Building Day",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7748e83e534ae778e143918dabbe735ec1416cc8bbdc5d7d835f67545dc6a7fa",
      "text": "Wukong has a big plan.\n“I will build a tall castle!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ca1d40037edae2860a16e92ed933ae946439686c3432cd6d136e0e3c5827a7f",
      "text": "“I will build the roof,” says\nNezha.\n“And a kitchen!” says Pigsy.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "25efd672ae5e50ccb8883d2bd5c1bbf520630c76de28d922eca4f7e8668ee05a",
      "text": "Wukong stacks the bricks up\nhigh.\nThe base is small and thin.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0625ab941121d8cbcce9be42b869969b67bd413d58ad6ced87644c0bec1df3d3",
      "text": "Nezha puts the roof on top.\nWiggle, wobble. The tall\ncastle leans!\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c48c29232d012f8feb9edaf0bea94b2e3daefe2a5625120351ce3ece4a7a8d9b",
      "text": "Wukong holds one side with\nhis tail.\nBut the other side wobbles,\ntoo!\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec2b3d7227ca20e55914192402fee1f82a11789731b0e81fbf1710c18f7b6ee9",
      "text": "They lift the roof off.\nWukong sits down.\n“My castle will not stand.”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "39a526a0470173c98ceb93ff837c54e3a4908929481cbaa04390f93095c03576",
      "text": "“Let’s build a wide base,” says\nNezha.\n“Wide, like my lunch plate!”\nsays Pigsy.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7df6e119e7c820a4c3e4e3cb5e37d7f9fae3620c907a7613dbe91f8938565b34",
      "text": "They take off a few bricks.\nThen they build the base out\nwide.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "41058979f69b4bc9a55627416ed6a3e4c059203a14350b74af2dbc55ed566cad",
      "text": "Click, click, click.\nThey press the bricks\ntogether.\nThe walls feel firm.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d8cee19022bf99fe8dd4adaea61b4915adb1623f11fd378de3aec98f331523f8",
      "text": "Nezha puts the blue roof\nback.\nThe castle stands!\n“Now for my kitchen!” says\nPigsy.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2670fc4d95a0e3ed9273834db654d1d15d9bf2f366a105e2c364ad56848c890c",
      "text": "Pigsy brings his little toy pot.\nHe tries the door.\nBump. The pot will not fit.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a0372a5516d38c840871dc094003d4091f86dd8383f67132c8425cc9231605c8",
      "text": "Pigsy looks inside the empty\npot.\n“Could you be a little\nthinner?”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f11e500311e234fff4d9a069ab2cce07e1fedb89ffb4b5aee5b270dba8df0e87",
      "text": "Wukong looks at his new wall.\n“But we just built that!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d220510b7594070ff120b574076b52e27da749b68bed02d57a54241d62338bbc",
      "text": "“Just this bit,” says Nezha.\n“We can make a wider door.”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd7bfeecb088a2efbfc5dbbe8aea7c6bdf14e2cc3c668fcaa7d8b796aecd69f7",
      "text": "They lift off the blue roof.\nOne small change. A wide\ndoor!\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e863e1225a33aeaa26bada1bc29edec41adb921ebe31b9c3e43a30e27a014fd1",
      "text": "Pigsy tries the pot again.\n“In you go!”\nThis time, the pot fits.\n17",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37a694be75bdbe10d996897a9a7e6c45e924d7066afcdf721e73150c871b33ac",
      "text": "They put the roof back on.\nToy friends come through the\nwide door.\n18",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7065e61996c7a5573d6d6c71e52aa10417301bccf1838c1c63dae79bffad8886",
      "text": "Wukong adds a little side\nwindow.\nHis tail waves through it.\n“Hello, castle!”\n19",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5381ab505786005d1e4e79fa34554b96f5bae642aa7c4c84ff18789f029d9bd6",
      "text": "They put the loose bricks\naway.\nNow all their toy friends fit.\nPigsy gets his little kitchen\nready.\n20",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
